@startuml sequence-transfer
title Transfer between one's own wallets

actor "Client" as Client
participant "individuals-api" as IA
box "transaction-service" #F5F9FF
    participant "TransactionService" as TS
    participant "WalletService" as WS
    database "DB (the user's shard)" as DB
end box

== init: compute the terms, nothing is written ==
Client -> IA: POST /api/v1/transactions/transfer/init
IA -> IA: user_uid from the token
IA -> TS: calc transfer conditions (init)
TS -> WS: check both wallets (belong to user_uid, active, same currency)
WS --> TS: OK, fee, available balance
TS --> IA: transfer terms
IA --> Client: transfer terms

== confirm: the whole transfer ==
Client -> IA: POST /api/v1/transactions/transfer/confirm
IA -> TS: confirm transfer
group one DB transaction
    TS -> WS: Debit + Credit
    WS -> DB: lock both wallets (FOR UPDATE, by ascending uid)
    WS -> DB: check the balance, debit A, credit B
    TS -> DB: transaction COMPLETED (target_wallet_uid = B)
end
TS --> IA: status=COMPLETED, transactionId
IA --> Client: status=COMPLETED, transactionId
@enduml
